{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18837","headline":"武夫词 · 刘禹锡","name":"武夫词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"武夫何洸洸，衣紫袭绦裳。\n借问胡爲尔，列校在鹰扬。\n依倚将军势，交结少年场。\n探丸害公吏，抽刃妒名倡。\n家产既不事，顾盼自生光。\n酣歌高楼上，袒裼大道傍。\n昔爲编户人，秉耒甘哺糠。\n今来从军乐，跃马饫膏粱。\n犹思风尘起，无种取侯王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18837.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18837","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}